OL,3,GNEWSA'I focused on getting a baby, not
OL,4,Awhat came next'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter Natalie Taylor-Johnson had her
OL,7,Fson three months ago, the grief she had
OL,8,F"bottled away" from years of struggling
OL,9,Fto conceive finally caught up with her.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, and her husband
OL,12,FCharlie, from Pill in North Somerset,
OL,13,Fhad tried to conceive naturally for two
OL,14,Fyears before starting IVF treatment
OL,15,Fthree years ago.
OL,17,FThe couple went through eight embryo
OL,18,Ftransfers and two unsuccessful
OL,19,Fpregnancies before falling pregnant
OL,20,Fwith their son, adding at 12 weeks she
OL,21,F"felt this is the one".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
