OL,3,GNEWSA'I focused on getting a baby, not
OL,4,Awhat came next'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "A lot of people that go
OL,7,Fthrough IVF focus on getting to the
OL,8,Fbaby and they don't really think about
OL,9,Fwhat comes next. I'd say that was
OL,10,Fabsolutely true for me."
